{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Remove the unsupported `queue` key.** GitHub Actions `concurrency` accepts `group` and `cancel-in-progress`; `queue: max` makes this workflow fail validation before any job runs. The same key was added to `cloud-tests.yml` and `conformance-tests.yml`, disabling those workflows too. Remove all three keys, and use an external locking/dispatch mechanism if every pending run must be retained.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM76fv31","finding_digest":"0c85d5ddd77c0008d3c9d5675339215ae4dab5e40d709bed937a698de065ecb4","finding_id":"arf_v1_bsc5lxoxpqaaru6j2vtvgojbll","finding_key":"github/workflows::concurrency::unsupported-queue-key","identity_key":"github/workflows::concurrency::unsupported-queue-key","line":56,"observation_digest":"31dae7cf767c90a26307bd5af6899abf7cd41c7264ca2296d45a5b1088635d79","observation_id":"aro_v1_ghnopt3wpsikeyyhxvnpncm2x5","path":".github/workflows/opentelemetry-conformance-tests.yml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T02:59:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_twcuaucw7pcbaposh4sexb3e2n","reviewed_base_sha":"d3b2ddfc73a350593644e628aa91a7ad7aa525e2","reviewed_head_sha":"68166eb6b38c45f2ba3c69ed4e694acfb4fb83cf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":56,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":753},"record_id":"art_v1_t5pftgs2loir6oarf474m4sdtm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T02:59:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
